WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Jumping heavy punch begins the wider-spacing example.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Crouching heavy punch connects before the launcher.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.400
OD Yoga Flame launches the opponent farther away.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.200
Standing heavy kick connects, raising the source hit counter from seven to eight.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.450
Dhalsim activates Level 1 after the heavy-kick juggle.

6
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.270
The opponent lands out of range while Level 1 passes overhead.
